==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|слѣ́довать||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|след|-овать}}.

{{sense|to be necessary, proper, expected or worthwhile}} For the relation with the derived term {{m|ru|пресле́довать}}, compare typologically {{m|ru|пови́нность}} (<…~ {{m|ru|вина́}} << {{m+|ine-pro|*weyh₁-}}).

{{sense|to go}} Compare typologically {{m+|en|march}} (akin to {{m|en|mark}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|сле́довать}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-следовать.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|сле́довать|impf|pf=после́довать}}

# to [[follow]] (move continually behind someone or something) {{+obj|ru|:за(ins)<behind whom/what>}}
#: {{syn|ru|[[идти́]] [[сле́дом]] [[за]]<q:or other motion verb>|[[идти́]] [[вслед]] [[за]]<q:or other motion verb>}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Сле́дуйте''' [[за]] [[мной]].|'''Follow''' me.}}
#* {{RQ:RSB|Mark|5|37|И не позволил никому '''следовать''' за Собою, кроме Петра, Иакова и Иоанна, брата Иакова.}}
# to [[follow]] (in sequence), to be [[next]] {{+obj|ru|:за(ins)<behind whom/what>}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[ночь|Ночь]] '''сле́дует''' [[за]] [[днём]].|Night '''follows''' day.}}
# {{lb|ru|impersonal}} to [[follow]] (logically, consequentially), to be a [[consequence]], to [[ensue]]
#: {{syn|ru|вытека́ть}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[из|Из]] [[э́того]] '''сле́дует''' (([[сде́лать]]) [[вы́вод]]), [[что]]...|It '''follows''' that...|lit=From this '''follows''' ((making) the conclusion) that...}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[отсюда|Отсю́да]] '''сле́дует''' (([[сде́лать]]) [[вы́вод]]), [[что]]...|It '''follows''' that...|lit=Hence '''follows''' ((making) the conclusion) that...}}
# {{lb|ru|impersonal}} to be [[necessary]], [[proper]], [[expected]] or [[worthwhile]] ({{n-g|used in constructions meaning "should(n't)", "must(n't)" etc., {{+obj|ru|dat<who>}}}})
#: {{syn|ru|на́до|ну́жно|сто́ить}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[не|Не]] '''сле́дует''' [[так]] [[поступа́ть]].|You '''should'''n't do that / behave like that.|lit=It doesn't '''follow''' to act like that.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[ему|Ему́]] '''сле́дует''' [[сро́чно]] [[прибы́ть]] [[на]] [[вокза́л]].|He '''should''' urgently arrive at the station.}}
# {{lb|ru|literary}} to [[follow]] {{gl|to be guided by something, act in accordance with something}} {{+obj|ru|dat<something>}}
#: {{syn|ru|руково́дствоваться}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''сле́довать''' [[при́нципу]]|'''to follow''' a principle}}
# {{lb|ru|[[official#English|official]]|of trains, buses etc.}} to [[follow]] a [[route]], to [[be]] [[bound]] (for), to [[travel]], to [[go]]
#: {{syn|ru|отправля́ться}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[автобус|Авто́бус]] '''сле́дует''' [[до]] [[аэропо́рта]].|The bus '''is bound''' for the airport.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[поезд|По́езд]] '''сле́дует''' [[без]] [[остано́вок]].|The train has no stops.}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|impf-intr|2a|сле́довать}}

